### WP2: Registered lensed marginalized prior + LensedPosterior reuse wiring
  What: Add the registered prior LensedMarginalizedExtrinsicIASPrior (intrinsic CBC subpriors + the four reduced lens subpriors, extrinsic removed), pairing with LensedMarginalizedExtrinsicLikelihood, and confirm the existing LensedPosterior + Posterior.from_event construction path pairs with it unchanged (delta_t_max threaded via likelihood_kwargs; refusals→-inf). Export the prior. Do NOT author tests.
